{"hymn":"S256","parent":"E312","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Gracia al oído es","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Salvos por gracia","syl":{"n1":["Gra","i"],"n2":["cia‿al","t"],"n3":["o","i"],"n4":["í","m"],"n5":["do","t"],"n6":"es","n7":["So","i"],"n8":["ni","m"],"n9":["do","t"],"n10":["ce","i"],"n11":["les","m"],"n12":["tial;","t"],"n13":"Del","n14":["cie","i"],"n15":["lo‿un","t"],"n16":["e","i"],"n17":["co","t"],"n18":["so","i"],"n19":["na","m"],"n20":["rá,","t"],"n21":"La","n22":["tie","i"],"n23":["rra","t"],"n24":["lo‿o","i"],"n25":["i","m"],"n26":["rá.","t"],"n28":["¡Gra","i"],"n29":["cia","t"],"n30":"sin","n31":["i","i"],"n32":["gual!","t"],"n34":["¡Bas","i"],"n35":["ta","t"],"n36":"su","n37":["po","i"],"n38":["der!","t"],"n40":["Es","i"],"n41":["ta","t"],"n42":["gra","i"],"n43":["cia‿es","t"],"n44":["Cris","i"],"n45":["to‿en","t"],"n46":"mí;","n47":["¡I","i"],"n48":["na","m"],"n49":["go","m"],"n50":["ta","m"],"n51":["ble‿es","t"],"n52":"Él!"},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["La gracia me‿otorgó","La vida eternal;","Ella‿al Cordero me llevó,","Quitando mi pesar."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["La gracia me guió;","Un peregrino soy;","Me suple cada‿hora‿a mí","Al ir en pos de Dios."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["La gracia me‿hizo orar;","Ella me compungió;","Me ha guardado hasta‿aquí;","Me‿anima‿el corazón."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["La gracia cubrirá","La obra de Su‿amor;","La piedra cimera‿Èl pondrá;","Digna‿es de‿aclamación."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["¡Oh, que Tu gracia‿en mí","Inspire‿el corazón!","Todo mi ser ofrezco‿a Ti;","Mis días Tuyos son."]}]}